*  CONTROL, GREEN -- the SAME pattern stored in a variable and matched through the compiled
*  PAT$n blob.  Prints A/AB/ABC correctly.  This is the one-token twin of rty_fail_bal_inline
*  and proves the defect is the INLINE road, not BAL and not FAIL semantics.
        p = BAL $ OUTPUT FAIL
        'ABC' ? POS(0) p
        OUTPUT = 'done'
END
